== Trivia ==
*'''Keran'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s name may be a reference to the term [[w:Karen (slang)|Karen]], used to describe a white woman perceived as entitled or demanding.
*"Sulphurcare" may be a reference to the [[w:Affordable Care Act|Affordable Care Act]], nicknamed "Obamacare".

